==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|cu|ru}} {{term|домови|lang=cu||to the house}}, the [[dative case|dative]] singular of {{term|домъ|lang=cu}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Ru-домой.ogg|audio}}

===Adverb===
'''домой''' (domój)

# [[home]], [[homeward]]s, to the [[house]]
#:* {{Cyrl|[[я|Мне]] [[пора|пора́]] домо́й}} — ''It’s time for me to go home.''

